    "detailed_description": "Prepare to enter the Isle of Wicklan, the last bastion of the mortals. This sanctuary, standing as the final defense against the Kingdom of Niav and its infernal adversaries, now faces an encroaching darkness. A vile blight spreads, threatening to consume the land. Wicklan must not succumb.<br><br>Revived by the Gods, a once notorious thief and criminal embarks on a journey to save this mist-shrouded realm from eternal damnation. As your ethereal wisp and mortal body reunite you must unveil Wicklan's secrets and thwart the greatest evil\u2014The Damned.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456020/extras/31ed27550dbecaef29ad9deec02fae92.avif?t=1724961448\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Harness Divine Power: Wield the celestial magic bestowed by the Gods alongside the mortal weaponry of swords, spears, and axes.<br></li><li> Master Witchcraft: Unleash potent spells to obliterate the encroaching darkness.<br></li><li> Gather Resources: Scavenge for equipment, potions, and artifacts essential for your quest to save humanity.</li></ul><br>Shape the world to your will. Relentlessly defend this land from the looming threat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456020/extras/6e0b7f464bff8f01b79ed75d3f99ec5b.avif?t=1724961448\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Divine Artifacts: To survive and restore Wicklan, utilize the sacred artifacts gifted by the Gods. Your resurrection is their hope to protect what remains and reclaim the lost.<br><br></li><li> Epic Exploration: Traverse caves, scale mountains, and explore dense forests to restore balance. Man\u2019s existence is at stake.<br><br></li><li> Battle Ferocious Enemies: Confront the Windralock in the Forest of Glass, hunt Shades and Rogues, and challenge the Kodlins across the plains. The fate of the universe rests on your shoulders.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456020/extras/758a5d8744dfa90545cb4d5edf8dd419.avif?t=1724961448\" /></span>",
