rse rests on your shoulders.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456020/extras/758a5d8744dfa90545cb4d5edf8dd419.avif?t=1724961448\" /></span>",
